3. edit_file ΓÇô Replace the first occurrence of specified text in a file  
4. list_directory ΓÇô List files in a directory  
5. web_fetch ΓÇô Fetch a URLΓÇÖs response body  
6. web_search ΓÇô Perform web searches via Brave Search API  
7. browser_open ΓÇô Open a URL in a browser  
8. browser_screenshot ΓÇô Capture a browser screenshot  
9. browser_click ΓÇô Click in the browser at specified coordinates  
10. browser_type ΓÇô Type text into the active browser  
11. screen_capture ΓÇô Capture the full screen or a window  
12. cdp_execute ΓÇô Run a Chrome DevTools Protocol script  
